Package: nuxdroid-desktop-libs
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: aarch64
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: NuxDroid <nuxdroid@local>
Depends: coreutils
Description: Shared X11, cairo, pango and glib libraries for the NuxDroid
 desktop. Bundled copies referenced through LD_LIBRARY_PATH set by the
 nuxdroid-session startup script.
